# Always install on iPhone 16 Pro after release

Owner: **Nanda**. Related: `.cursor/rules/versioning.mdc`, `.cursor/rules/android-github-release-tags.mdc`, TECHNICAL §14.

## User policy (RU intent)

«Всегда ставь на iPhone» — after every app ship/release, **always** install the shipped build on the physical **iPhone 16 Pro**.

## When (required)

Do this at the end of any of:

- Marketing version bump / product ship (`1.x.y`)
- GitHub Release (APK/IPA) or «коммит + релиз + пуш»
- Explicit reinstall request («поставь», «поставь еще раз»)

Pure docs/chore/rule-only commits need **not** install unless the user asks.

## Device

- Nickname: **Nanda** (wireless or USB)
- Model: **iPhone 16 Pro** (`iPhone17,1`)
- UDID (typical): `00008140-00121CC82179801C`
- Bundle ID: `com.nanda070.neptunmobile`

## How

1. Prefer: `flutter run --release -d Nanda` (or the device UDID).
2. If wireless Flutter fails: `flutter build ios --release` then `xcrun devicectl device install app --device <UDID> <path-to-.app>` + launch.
3. Confirm on device: `CFBundleShortVersionString` / Settings version equals the shipped marketing `1.x.y` (three numbers; no `+build`).

## Do not

- Skip the physical phone install after a product release because “docs were updated” or Android was shipped.
- Leave only a simulator install as the release check.
